      "content": "$$\\begin{array}{l} P(\\vec{a}, \\vec{b}) - P(\\vec{a}, \\vec{c}) = - \\int d\\lambda\\rho(\\lambda) [A(\\vec{a}, \\lambda) A(\\vec{b}, \\lambda) - A(\\vec{a}, \\lambda) A(\\vec{c}, \\lambda)] \\\\ = \\int d\\lambda\\rho(\\lambda) A(\\vec{a}, \\lambda) A(\\vec{b}, \\lambda) [A(\\vec{b}, \\lambda) A(\\vec{c}, \\lambda) - 1] \\end{array}$$",
